# The Temple of Desolation not current (The Gate of the Gods current): Aldo and Gilgamesh say nothing, _700 is Norg's
# DefaultActions DOOR_IS_LOCKED, Kamui its DefaultActions 61, and _6z0 the NPC's own 1, whose finish does nothing.
lists LowerJeuno/Aldo/onTrigger Norg/_700/onTrigger Norg/Gilgamesh/onTrigger Norg/Kamui/onTrigger HallOfTheGods/_6z0/onTrigger HallOfTheGods/onEventFinish/1
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=23,3,-58 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart TheGateOfTheGods current
login
trigger Aldo                            # nothing
finish-if-event
warp 98,-7,-12 Norg
trigger _700                            # DOOR_IS_LOCKED
finish-if-event
trigger Gilgamesh                       # nothing
finish-if-event
trigger Kamui                           # DefaultActions' 61
finish-if-event
warp 0,-14,46 HallOfTheGods
trigger _6z0                            # the NPC's own 1
finish                                  # nothing
